Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.18,0:00:11.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)谁啊？你是。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.48,0:00:15.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(巴利安) 吾乃巴利安。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.27,0:00:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.34,0:00:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说你是巴利安！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.38,0:00:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 为了毁灭星光界而来的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安世界的使者。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)那就是巴利安。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.35,0:00:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)巴利安……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好看着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.91,0:00:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心脏地球龙的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.13,0:00:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽在没有超量素材的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.72,0:00:51.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}状态下被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.77,0:00:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以仅复活一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.31,0:00:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.94,0:00:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心脏地球·龙的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.28,0:00:59.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将变为被除外的卡的数量乘以
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.36,0:01:00.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1000点。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.35,0:01:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)攻击力4000！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 心脏地球·龙还
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.20,0:01:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.91,0:01:11.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.37,0:01:13.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有怪兽变为守备表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.16,0:01:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能！新银河眼他。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.96,0:01:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.76,0:01:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在倒下还太早了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.47,0:01:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.43,0:01:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续魔法 壁垒之门！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.38,0:01:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合每有1只怪兽被送入墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.48,0:01:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就给予800点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.28,0:01:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.23,0:01:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了，我们的生命值已经只剩100了……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.72,0:01:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，你们就完蛋了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.94,0:01:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，心之地龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.63,0:01:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击新银河眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.14,0:01:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心碎加农炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.27,0:01:59.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱 光子逃脱！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.25,0:02:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.03,0:02:03.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子怪兽被攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.54,0:02:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那只怪兽除外结束战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然还留有抵抗的力量吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.92,0:02:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 就在这一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.15,0:02:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之地球龙的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.72,0:02:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有一张被除外的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.51,0:02:17.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上升1000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.99,0:02:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 5000。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.04,0:02:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈尔特……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.87,0:02:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.10,0:02:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}屏障！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.32,0:02:36.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果你们是来夺走哈尔特的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.96,0:02:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就来夺夺看吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.08,0:02:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就在这里做个了断。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.69,0:02:45.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈尔特！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.05,0:02:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(哈尔特)啊 哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.43,0:02:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动 次元游侠的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:51.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.35,0:02:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽被除外时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.20,0:02:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将手牌中的这张卡送入墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.86,0:02:59.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把被除外的怪兽2只的攻击力合计{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.21,0:03:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对手伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.78,0:03:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择的是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.67,0:03:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼龙·恶齿与 新银河眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.20,0:03:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 给予你的伤害合计为
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.77,0:03:11.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}7300点！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.57,0:03:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太厉害了 快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:15.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然还留着这样的手段。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.10,0:03:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 我的最后一击。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.66,0:03:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.50,0:03:23.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧超越次元的攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.66,0:03:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 新银河眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}究极光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.37,0:03:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 鲨鱼龙·恶齿。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深渊鲨咬！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.31,0:03:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，好棋啊海马。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续魔法 障壁之门
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:03:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的另一个效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.78,0:04:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将这张卡送去墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.93,0:04:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使对方怪兽的效果无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.17,0:04:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然躲过了刚才那一击？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.05,0:04:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂、喂 海马！没事吧，喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.51,0:04:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨……鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.99,0:04:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真遗憾啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.05,0:04:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来剩下的就只有九十九游马 你这家伙了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.33,0:06:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值所剩无几。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.06,0:06:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上也没有怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.57,0:06:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 九十九游马{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.67,0:06:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在绝望的尽头与星光世界一同{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.41,0:06:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失于黑暗的彼方吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.38,0:06:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶，竟然在这种地方……。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.70,0:06:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.21,0:06:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.28,0:06:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.34,0:06:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.75,0:06:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你总是为了我……我的……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.73,0:06:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎、怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.79,0:06:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈尔特……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.47,0:07:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.89,0:07:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈尔特 你……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.65,0:07:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈尔特 你这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.13,0:07:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道我赋予的屏障之力……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.17,0:07:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能……球形力场竟然！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.07,0:07:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 就是现在。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.97,0:07:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到星光体那里去。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.74,0:07:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.03,0:07:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.68,0:07:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你和星光体的力量让那家伙见识见识。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.75,0:07:34.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.18,0:07:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.41,0:07:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:07:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.91,0:08:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}沸腾起来吧 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.47,0:08:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.91,0:08:09.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.07,0:08:12.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和你 叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.70,0:08:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们两人构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.00,0:08:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当遥远的两个灵魂交汇之时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.87,0:08:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被传颂的力量将会显现。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异热同心变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.59,0:08:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马/星光体)泽阿尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.58,0:08:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.50,0:08:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马和星光体 两人的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.33,0:08:49.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泽阿尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.98,0:08:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是星光体世界的力量 泽阿尔…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.22,0:08:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安！ 就算你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.84,0:09:00.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}挡在我们面前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.46,0:09:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑暗中闪耀的希望！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.57,0:09:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这胸中炽热燃烧 猛然闪耀！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.26,0:09:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将你打倒！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.87,0:09:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.24,0:09:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最强的决斗者
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.60,0:09:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连抽卡都能创造。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.10,0:09:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 我们命运的一抽！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.02,0:09:22.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪耀抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.22,0:09:29.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤异热同心武器 究极盾！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.08,0:09:38.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动究极盾的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.12,0:09:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.88,0:09:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将被除外的怪兽超量素材的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.89,0:09:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.04,0:09:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以守备表示最多特殊召唤3只。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.12,0:09:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.50,0:09:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧 CNo.39！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.79,0:09:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.14,0:10:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.31,0:10:03.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我们合力！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.66,0:10:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咆哮吧 CNo.32！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.70,0:10:10.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼·龙·拜斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.15,0:10:14.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}苏醒吧，我的灵魂！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.37,0:10:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 被除外的这3只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
