Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.19,0:10:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼龙攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.19,0:10:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降3000！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看到了吗？这就是我们的底力！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.76,0:10:35.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟敢耍这种花招！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.85,0:10:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但你们这些家伙的结局不会改变！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.40,0:10:39.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好看着吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.98,0:10:40.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.25,0:10:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}球形力场炮竟然！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.48,0:10:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然让Astral逃掉了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.65,0:10:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但作为球形力场炮的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.65,0:10:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经足够了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.81,0:10:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管你们再耍什么手段
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.73,0:10:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都阻止不了这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:11:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有人一起 连同Astral世界
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:03.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.44,0:11:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.13,0:11:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把一切 都托付给你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.70,0:11:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把那家伙打倒！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.92,0:11:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！我给希望皇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.55,0:11:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备上阿尔提梅特护盾！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.85,0:11:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由此
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.33,0:11:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇的守备力上升2000！
