Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.24,0:11:30.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动装备魔法 超量团结！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.33,0:11:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这张卡的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.98,0:11:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把希望皇变为攻击表示！
