Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.07,0:11:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加上自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守备怪兽的攻击力！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.72,0:11:46.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 攻击力是9800！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.19,0:11:48.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.95,0:11:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊 希望皇！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.88,0:11:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没用的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.59,0:11:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管你把攻击力提得多高{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.91,0:11:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之地球·龙将
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.18,0:12:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过战斗造成的伤害无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
