Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.63,0:12:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这个效果，我将
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.78,0:12:11.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼·龙·维斯送入墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.35,0:12:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将希望皇的攻击次数增加1次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.15,0:12:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以直接攻击你！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.59,0:12:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会让你得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.85,0:12:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续陷阱 屏障·战斗·爆裂！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.83,0:12:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以
