Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.63,0:12:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使直接攻击无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.43,0:12:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 还没完！
