Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.77,0:12:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再吃一记直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.32,0:12:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愚蠢。永续陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}屏障·战斗·爆裂的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.33,0:12:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.37,0:13:02.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 将这张屏障·战斗·爆裂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.84,0:13:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送入墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.04,0:13:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}强制让场上的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.96,0:13:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.50,0:13:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.91,0:13:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去希望皇进行战斗的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.23,0:13:14.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}6800的伤害会反弹到我们身上！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.78,0:13:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下真的结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.01,0:13:28.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}坠入地狱吧！
