Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.79,0:13:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将那个数值加在这张卡的攻击力上！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.07,0:13:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 心之地龙的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.97,0:13:47.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.79,0:13:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋 笨蛋 笨蛋～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.02,0:14:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下这16600的攻击吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.94,0:14:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧～ 霍普雷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.83,0:14:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之地龙 攻击巴利安！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.45,0:14:11.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑·究极斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.58,0:14:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶 你们这些家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.39,0:14:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看到了吗 巴利安这就是我们的羁绊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:38.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.25,0:14:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈尔特！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.52,0:14:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.06,0:15:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈尔特！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.18,0:15:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈尔特！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.86,0:15:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.15,0:15:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经没事了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.34,0:15:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的噩梦全都消失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.58,0:15:24.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夏克！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.00,0:15:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟 小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.48,0:15:33.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欧比塔尔 你要睡到什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.38,0:15:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欧比塔尔7！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.24,0:15:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(欧比塔尔7)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.84,0:15:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵 遵命 是！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.41,0:15:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.23,0:15:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 凯特。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.52,0:15:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.43,0:15:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸 爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.92,0:15:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欧比塔尔 哈尔特就交给你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.36,0:15:59.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特大人 难道说？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥？ 哥～哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.24,0:16:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸我会带回来的一定会带回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.82,0:16:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟 大家就交给你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.31,0:16:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.63,0:16:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯
