Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.52,0:16:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在哪啊 爸爸？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.15,0:16:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.36,0:16:51.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.43,0:16:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.07,0:17:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 九十九游马
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.09,0:17:08.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你为什么要对我？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.49,0:17:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我确实恨你。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.51,0:17:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 你拼命想让哈尔特活下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.74,0:17:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是爸爸的话一定会笑着说没办法的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.78,0:17:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经够了 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.37,0:17:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我犯下的罪太重了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.17,0:17:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不应该被原谅。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.99,0:17:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.19,0:17:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（多隆）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.63,0:17:39.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.65,0:17:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的罪太重了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.76,0:17:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.02,0:17:52.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.69,0:17:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.70,0:18:02.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆…住手 特隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.65,0:18:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复仇已经结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.70,0:18:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜 拜隆…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.70,0:18:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}求你了 拜隆快斗他们没有罪。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.50,0:18:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}错的全都是我。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.82,0:18:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.98,0:18:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手！ 特隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.38,0:18:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是我最后的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.44,0:18:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事的…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.60,0:18:54.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:18:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为 游马总是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.04,0:19:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦 咦？ 我？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.04,0:19:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哟 哟！ 小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.40,0:19:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.57,0:19:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸！ 哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.75,0:19:27.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 喂 你哭什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.50,0:19:28.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.01,0:19:31.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的！ 你真的是个笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.67,0:19:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总是 总是让人担心！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.53,0:19:41.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝隆…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((贝隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.31,0:19:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}费卡…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.22,0:19:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝隆 对不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.60,0:19:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见了 朋友…))
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.10,0:20:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你原谅了这样的我。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.75,0:20:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做事不考虑后果老是乱来！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.74,0:20:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那有什么办法啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.43,0:20:19.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不是没办法吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.33,0:20:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轰隆)怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.20,0:20:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的状态呢？ 多洛瓦。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.30,0:20:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多洛瓦)应急处理已经做完了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.22,0:20:31.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 快一点 轰隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.10,0:20:32.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.47,0:20:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托你了，戈什！特洛瓦。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.78,0:20:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.07,0:20:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都是我的错。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.94,0:20:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我的错。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.71,0:20:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原谅我吧，春人、海斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.09,0:20:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.46,0:20:52.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你那永不放弃的心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.76,0:20:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以及相信同伴的羁绊{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.35,0:20:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为大家取回了希望之光。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:20:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢你》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.30,0:21:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来结束了啊，决斗嘉年华。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.85,0:21:06.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不！还没结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.51,0:21:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没拿到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.84,0:21:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗嘉年华优胜者的奖品呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.03,0:21:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂、喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.02,0:21:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊，这种时候？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.14,0:21:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿！决斗嘉年华的优胜者{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.51,0:21:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以实现自己的愿望对吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.78,0:21:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的愿望是让快斗他们父子和睦地生活在一起！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.72,0:21:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多管闲事。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.31,0:21:38.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.62,0:21:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说你多管闲事。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.65,0:21:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，我知道了知道了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.04,0:21:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那这就是我真正的愿望！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.47,0:21:50.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！我和你的了断还没结束呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.93,0:21:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟我决斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.11,0:21:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此，有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.84,0:21:58.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说这是事实上的决赛吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.02,0:22:00.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧，我接受。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.02,0:22:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.02,0:22:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！燃起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.81,0:23:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
